    "protocol": "Static 0 K relaxations (BFGS, fmax 0.01 eV/A). Bulk fcc Cu cell relaxed (a0=3.626 A). Cu(111) slab, 3x3 surface cell, 4 layers, bottom 2 fixed, 10 A vacuum each side, O at 1/9 ML. Sites fcc/hcp/bridge/top scanned; bridge relaxes into fcc. E_ads = E(O/slab) - E(slab) - E(O atom, isolated, model energy). Convergence checks: 2x2x4 (1/4 ML) and 3x3x5 slabs.",
    "ensemble": "static 0 K (no ZPE, no thermal terms)",
    "timestep_fs": null,
    "n_atoms": 37,
    "sim_length_ps": null,
    "seeds": null
